[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0335","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0335.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0544","title":"Aprelium Abyss Web Server 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-0544是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0544"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:38Z","remediation":"立即将 Aprelium Abyss Web Server 升级至 1.0.3 或更高版本，该版本已将 abyss.conf 中的管理控制台密码改为加密存储而非明文。升级前作为临时缓解措施，应修改 abyss.conf 文件权限为仅限管理员账户读写（如 chmod 600），并立即将其中明文密码更改为强密码，防止本地用户读取配置文件获取管理员权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.aprelium.com/news/abws103.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4467","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21367","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8e5677efdddb9343c4d7ff6efe8ac6dc3b41098/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0544.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b858c1de67d8192aba338799e4dc25fc6df3edc6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0544.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0544","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0544.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0544.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/dcf23aed58c5cab14c2c44b30593196b46bb051f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0544.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c1096ae2c739fb24857b16bf09f0fefbd8cfadc2/2002/CVE-2002-0544.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b50573b11cc979cd742f854e751c69c1ee415eb0/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0544.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0544.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0544.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0335.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0335.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0335.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0334","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0334.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0542","title":"OpenBSD mail 命令注入漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-0542是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0542"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:38Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenBSD 3.0（2002年4月11日 errata 018 之后版本）或更高版本，或手动应用官方补丁 018_mail.patch 至 src/usr.bin/mail/collect.c 并重新编译 mail。具体操作：cd /usr/src && patch -p0 < 018_mail.patch，然后 cd usr.bin/mail && make cleandir && make obj && make depend && make && make install。同时检查 cron 中 mail 调用配置，禁用非必要的交互式 mail 调用以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101855467811695&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/267089","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8818.php","http://www.openbsd.org/errata30.html#mail","http://www.osvdb.org/5269","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4495","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21373","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8c5cb8015669b7fea66cc41d203b97a12e61abfc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0542.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be04a74d8eb7583856274b2516ee1145cf8d4218/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0542.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0542","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0542.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0542.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d7fec49e4355e166a4b0625e0b5eb4d2c8efa124/2002/CVE-2002-0542.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/387709ab0226578f568bf79a76d7e3ca05d5c97a/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0542.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/dcf23aed58c5cab14c2c44b30593196b46bb051f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0542.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0542.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/ac826e72f0dff1fdec5b136f30bdeaf366567e8e/content/CVE-2002-0542.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0334.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0333","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0540","title":"北电网络 CVX 1800 多业务接入交换机默认SNMP团体字符串漏洞","description":"Nortel CVX 1800 多业务接入交换机出厂时配置了默认的 SNMP 社区字符串 \"public\"，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 SNMP 协议远程读取设备中的用户名和密码信息，并修改交换机的配置参数。该漏洞影响运行默认配置的设备，攻击条件宽松，仅需网络可达即可利用。利用者可通过发送特制的 SNMP GET/SET 请求获取敏感凭证并篡改设备配置，可能导致网络被接管或配置被恶意修改。Microsoft 或厂商应修改默认社区字符串并限制 SNMP 访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0540"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:38Z","remediation":"建议将设备软件立即升级至 3.6.3P25 版本以修复该默认 SNMP 社区字符串漏洞。如暂无法升级，应立即将默认 SNMP 社区字符串从 \"public\" 修改为自定义的强密码字符串，并在设备上配置 SNMP 访问控制列表（ACL）以限制仅允许受信任的管理主机访问 SNMP 端口，同时通过防火墙或访问控制列表限制外部对 UDP 161 端口的访问，仅对授权网管主机开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0272.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/267627","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8848.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/403315","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4507","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21378","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0540.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0540.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0540","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0540.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0540.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c19e03a3f5c73c1254957c1cd474626aa25ecdd7/2002/CVE-2002-0540.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0540.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8059e8cdbda0c03add4039d02d7a1dd188f7b3c8/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0540.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0540.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/ac826e72f0dff1fdec5b136f30bdeaf366567e8e/content/CVE-2002-0540.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0332","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0332.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0539","title":"Demarc Security PureSecure 1.0.5 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Demarc PureSecure 1.0.5 版本（Unix/Windows 版本）存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可通过构造存储在 s_key Cookie 中的会话 ID 参数注入恶意 SQL 语句，绕过身份验证直接获取管理员权限。该漏洞影响 Demarc PureSecure 1.0.5 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重级），攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需身份认证，成功利用可导致系统机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失。攻击者只需构造恶意 SQL 语句注入到会话 ID Cookie 参数中，即可绕过认证机制直接获得系统最高权限。ExploitDB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码（ExploitDB-21384）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0539"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:38Z","remediation":"建议立即安装最新的微软安全更新（特定版本请查询官方公告）。如果无法立即更新，可先在防火墙设备中禁用不必要的服务端口，并加强对会话ID字段的输入验证和参数化查询，以减轻SQL注入风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0168.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/267941","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8854.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5239","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4520","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21384","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0539.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0539.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0539","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0539.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0539.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a27c62772ea5fd76d872ecc75532da5c81d4b7c3/2002/CVE-2002-0539.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0539.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0539.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0539.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/ac826e72f0dff1fdec5b136f30bdeaf366567e8e/content/CVE-2002-0539.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0332.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0329","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0329.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0536","title":"phpGroupWare SQL注入漏洞","description":"phpGroupWare 0.9.12 及更早版本在 PHP 配置中禁用 magic_quotes_gpc 特性时，存在 SQL 注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 SQL 语句注入到数据库查询中，绕过输入过滤机制，直接操作或破坏后端数据库。该漏洞影响所有运行在 magic_quotes_gpc 关闭环境下的 phpGroupWare 0.9.12 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者可通过构造恶意 SQL 语句注入到输入参数中，绕过 magic_quotes_gpc 保护机制缺失的输入过滤，直接执行任意 SQL 命令，导致数据库泄露、篡改或破坏。建议升级至修复版本或启用 PHP 的 magic_quotes_gpc 配置选项。Debian 已发布相关安全更新修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0536"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:37Z","remediation":"升级 phpGroupware 到 0.9.13 或更高版本（包含安全修复），并确保在安装时启用 PHP 配置项 magic_quotes_gpc 以自动转义特殊字符。如无法立即更新，可通过在 php.ini 文件中添加 `magic_quotes_gpc = On` 设置来临时缓解风险。此外，建议实施输入验证和使用预编译语句技术来进一步加强应用安全性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0036.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0143.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8755.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5153","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4424","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21365","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0536.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0536.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0536","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0536.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0536.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/32432109ff9e86b2bb98b1a1db62e571ca6165c8/2002/CVE-2002-0536.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0536.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0536.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0536.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/ac826e72f0dff1fdec5b136f30bdeaf366567e8e/content/CVE-2002-0536.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0329.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0329.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0328","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0328.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0535","title":"PostBoard PostBoard 2.0 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"PostBoard 2.0 存在跨站脚本漏洞，影响 2.0.1 及更早版本。攻击者可通过两种方式在 BBS 论坛中执行恶意脚本：首先，当 BBCode 功能启用时，攻击者可使用 [IMG] 标签注入脚本代码；其次，在主题标题中也可以嵌入恶意脚本。通过这些攻击向量，入侵者可以劫持用户会话、窃取登录凭证或执行其他非法操作，严重威胁用户账号安全和数据隐私。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用，属于中危级别。尽管当前影响范围相对有限，但随着社交媒体和论坛系统的广泛应用，此类 XSS 漏洞仍可能造成严重的安全风险，尤其当系统配置允许脚本执行时风险更高。攻击者通常通过构造恶意内容，利用用户对网站信任来实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0535"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:37Z","remediation":"建议立即停用 PostBoard 2.0.1 及更早版本，迁移至现代维护中的论坛系统（如 Discourse、phpBB 3.x、Flarum 等）。若必须继续使用，请立即在后台禁用 BBCode 功能（特别是 [IMG] 标签），并在发帖标题处增加严格的 HTML 实体转义与长度限制；同时在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面部署 XSS 防护规则，拦截包含 <script>、onerror、onload 等特征的请求；建议尽快完成系统迁移，彻底消除该遗留漏洞风险。更新至现代论坛系统最新稳定版，并启用 CSP 策略与 HttpOnly Cookie 防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/267936","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8881.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4559","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4561","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8884","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21403","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0535.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0535","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0535.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0535.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f52f1c038fbedc0ce9132a21fb74a8989887ee3/2002/CVE-2002-0535.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0535.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/9413a774aa3c18bbfa82e1c5748c45ab31f77f67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0535.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0535.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0535.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/ac826e72f0dff1fdec5b136f30bdeaf366567e8e/content/CVE-2002-0535.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0328.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0284","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0371","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer/ISA Server/Proxy Server Gopher 客户端远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.1 至 6.0、ISA Server 2000 及 Proxy Server 2.0 的 Gopher 客户端存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于客户端在处理 Gopher 服务器响应时未能正确验证数据长度。远程攻击者可以通过构造一个特制的 gopher:// URL，诱导用户访问并将其重定向至一个发送超长响应的恶意 Gopher 服务器，从而触发溢出并执行任意代码。此漏洞允许未经身份验证的远程攻击者完全控制受影响的目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0371"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:18Z","remediation":"建议用户立即升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 的最新补丁版本或更高版本的浏览器。对于服务器端，请安装 Microsoft ISA Server 2000 及 Proxy Server 2.0 的相关安全更新。若无法升级，可通过组策略或注册表禁用 Gopher 协议支持，防止攻击者通过 gopher:// 链接触发缓冲区溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102320516707940&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102397955217618&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/276848","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9247.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/440275","http://www.pivx.com/workaround_fail.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4930","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-027","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A98","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21510","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-0371.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0371.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0371","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0371.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0371.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0371.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0371.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8f9388ccf03511af7a94793190933c2b79f3688a/2002/CVE-2002-0371.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0371.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0371.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0284.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0200","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0187","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 SQLXML 跨站脚本注入漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 的 SQLXML 组件存在跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于 SQLXML 在处理 XML SQL 查询时，未对 `root` 参数中的输入内容进行充分过滤与转义，攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本代码的 XML 标签，利用 `root` 参数将任意脚本注入到服务器响应中，从而在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意 JavaScript 代码。未经身份认证的远程攻击者仅需能够访问启用了 SQLXML 功能的 SQL Server 实例即可发起攻击，利用该漏洞可窃取用户会话凭证、篡改页面内容或执行钓鱼攻击。Microsoft SQL Server 2000 全版本受影响，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0187"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:57Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-030 提供的补丁：SQL Server 2000 Gold 版下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyID=cf3f644b-f68f-4ec9-8808-34860f9dc31f，SQLXML 2.0 版下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyID=b10fdc29-ba8e-4869-98e4-08464b2c8dd3，SQLXML 3.0 版下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyID=05f1a309-be6e-49fe-968d-9833fa15cc12。安装后需重启服务器。如无法立即打补丁，应禁用 SQLXML HTTP 组件的虚拟目录，停止 IIS 中 SQLXML ISAPI 扩展的映射，并禁止通过 HTTP 执行即席 URL 查询。升级到 SQL Server 2000 SP3 及以上版本也可彻底修复此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102397345410856&w=2","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-030","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21541","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0187.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0187","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0187.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0187.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8fb1620294bff0cde2c82bba8543a916d4f0215c/2002/CVE-2002-0187.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0187.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0187.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0187.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0187.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0198","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0186","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 SQLXML ISAPI 扩展缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000 的 SQLXML ISAPI 扩展存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在 content-type 参数中传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 2000 默认安装版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS02-039 中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0186"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:57Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-039 提供的 SQL Server 2000 安全更新补丁。如无法安装补丁，可在 IIS 中移除 SQLXML ISAPI 扩展映射（删除 .xml 扩展名到 sqlxml.dll 的映射），或限制 IIS 中 SQLXML 虚拟目录的访问权限仅允许受信 IP 地址。鉴于 SQL Server 2000 已停止支持，建议升级至 SQL Server 2019 或更高版本以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0100.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102397345410856&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9328.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/811371","http://www.osvdb.org/5347","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5004","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-030","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A484","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A489","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21540","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0186.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0186","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0186.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0186.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8fb1620294bff0cde2c82bba8543a916d4f0215c/2002/CVE-2002-0186.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0186.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0186.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0186.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0186.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0186.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0198.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0184","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0378","title":"Red Hat Linux LPRng 打印后台服务未授权访问漏洞","description":"LPRng 打印假脱机服务存在默认配置不当的安全漏洞，影响 Red Hat Linux 7.0 至 7.3、Mandrake 8.1 和 8.2 以及其他使用 LPRng 的操作系统。该漏洞的根本原因是 LPRng 在默认安装配置下未对远程打印请求进行任何访问控制验证，允许任意远程主机向目标打印机服务提交打印作业。未经认证的攻击者可利用此漏洞从网络上任意位置发送恶意打印任务，可能导致打印机服务拒绝正常打印请求（DoS），消耗系统资源，或利用打印作业处理过程中可能存在的其他缺陷进行进一步攻击。CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可通过网络发起攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0378"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:19Z","remediation":"升级LPRng至最新安全版本，具体操作：Red Hat用户安装RHSA-2002-089提供的更新包（运行up2date或rpm -Uvh），Mandrake用户安装MDKSA-2002-042提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，修改/etc/lprng/lpd.perms配置文件，添加访问控制规则限制仅允许受信任IP段提交打印作业，并重启lpd服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4205","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9322.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-042.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-089.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4980","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0378.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0378.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0378.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0378","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0378.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0378.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5fdf468f2fb873a7503bb1902a9b5f49d74e59db/2002/CVE-2002-0378.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0378.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0378.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0378.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0184.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0008","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0651","title":"ISC BIND 派生 DNS 解析器代码（libc/glibc/libbind）缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 派生的 DNS 解析器代码（libc、glibc、libbind）中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程恶意 DNS 服务器可通过向使用 stub 解析器的客户端发送特制的 DNS 响应数据触发该溢出，导致目标系统拒绝服务，在特定条件下可实现任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响范围广泛，涉及大量使用上述库的 Linux/Unix 系统及网络设备。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0651"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:51Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2.5 及以上版本（Linux 发行版请使用包管理器更新：`apt-get install libc6` 或 `yum update glibc`），或升级 ISC BIND 至 8.3.3/9.2.1 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 DNS 解析器层面配置可信上游 DNS 服务器（如 `/etc/resolv.conf` 中仅指定内部受控 DNS），并在边界防火墙上限制对外部 DNS 服务器的出站查询，降低被恶意 DNS 服务器攻击的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/aix/2002-q3/0001.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/engarde/2002-q3/0002.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2002-q3/0000.html","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000507","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:038","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102513011311504&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102520962320134&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102579743329251&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-139.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-19.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9432.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/803539","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-043.php","http://www.pine.nl/advisories/pine-cert-20020601.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-119.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-133.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-167.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-154.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5100","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A4190","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0651.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2002/CVE-2002-0651.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0651.md","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/486c990d1562f3a9f79527b0aa854bf4fa7784c7/scripts/vulners.nse","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0651.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0651.md","https://github.com/vulnersCom/nmap-vulners/blob/0f21b75ca3148ba00910352a5622cfc250611477/vulners.nse","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0651","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0651.json","https://github.com/evyatarmeged/Raccoon/blob/44024abaa6ca420b6b2c6f06285df306f360eb22/raccoon_src/utils/misc/vulners.nse"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0007","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0640","title":"OpenSSH sshd 挑战响应认证缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 2.3.1 至 3.3 版本的 sshd 组件在处理挑战-响应认证时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 OpenBSD 系统使用 PAM 模块并启用交互式键盘认证（PAMAuthenticationViaKbdInt）时，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送大量认证响应数据触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低，影响范围广泛。受影响的 OpenSSH 版本需升级至 3.3 以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0640"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:50Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 sshd 在 PAM 交互式键盘认证（PAMAuthenticationViaKbdInt）中的挑战响应缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 sshd_config 中禁用 ChallengeResponseAuthentication 或 PAMAuthenticationViaKbdInt 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000502","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102514371522793&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102514631524575&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102521542826833&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102532054613894&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-18.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-134","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/369347","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2177.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:040","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_024_openssh_txt.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/07/01/3","http://www.osvdb.org/839","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-127.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-131.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5093","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0206-195","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21579","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0640.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/976754950fcf68c46d91206b7029022222e8684c/2002/CVE-2002-0640.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0640.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0640","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0640.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0640.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2002/CVE-2002-0640.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0640.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0640.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0640.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0006","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0639","title":"OpenSSH sshd 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 2.9.9 至 3.3 版本的 sshd 组件在处理挑战响应认证（ChallengeResponseAuthentication）时存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当 OpenSSH 启用 SKEY 或 BSD_AUTH 认证方式时，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的认证请求触发整数溢出，导致堆内存破坏，最终实现远程代码执行。攻击者可借此完全控制受影响服务器，安装恶意程序、窃取数据或创建后门。该漏洞影响范围广泛，危害等级严重，CVSS 评分 9.8。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0639"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSH 至 3.4 或更高版本。如无法升级，在 sshd_config 中设置 ChallengeResponseAuthentication no 和 PAMAuthenticationViaKbdInt no 禁用挑战响应认证，或启用 UsePrivilegeSeparation yes 以限制提权影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0335.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000502","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102514371522793&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102514631524575&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102521542826833&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-18.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-134","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9169.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/369347","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2177.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:040","http://www.osvdb.org/6245","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5093","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/